                                "sense_id": "bc51df99-09e1-3690-9327-9e5e87784069",
                                "text": "All the months of planning, the painstakingly gathered intelligence, the rehearsals carried out right under the Brit noses, the three escape routes, the radiomen—all for nothing because of this bloody meddler."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "936e7eb7-ea8c-45e7-8224-aad77e20b72c",
                                "sense_id": "bc51df99-09e1-3690-9327-9e5e87784069",
                                "text": "At Cruson’s fruit and veg shop an old woman is painstakingly going through all the onions netted in large red bags to find just the ones she wants."
                            }
                        ]
